{"id":"5260365ec2a618b9","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment.md","title":"Admissible Infinitary Language Fragment","display":"df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment — Admissible Infinitary Language Fragment","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment","aliases":["58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment"],"display":"df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment — Admissible Infinitary Language Fragment","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set]]","[[58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula]]","[[58-df-structure]]","[[58-df-satisfaction]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[../batch03/58-df-assignment]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper]]","[[58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-logic9-admissible-fragment — Admissible Infinitary Language Fragment"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4cbfb5925afe7f86\" href=\"?note=4cbfb5925afe7f86\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set\">58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5f363231f41efc07\" href=\"?note=5f363231f41efc07\" title=\"58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula\">58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"58-df-structure\">58-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8b6a90316aad78a4\" href=\"?note=8b6a90316aad78a4\" title=\"58-df-satisfaction\">58-df-satisfaction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"64f35ba2e87964e0\" href=\"?note=64f35ba2e87964e0\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-assignment\">../batch03/58-df-assignment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper\">../batch06/58-df-proper</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"ee7c4e8a31dc0b92\" href=\"?note=ee7c4e8a31dc0b92\" title=\"58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function\">58-df-zfc-inner3-definable-skolem-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> is an admissible set and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in A\">\\(L\\in A\\)</span> is a set-coded first-order signature.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\)</span> is the admissible-set predicate supplied by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4cbfb5925afe7f86\" href=\"?note=4cbfb5925afe7f86\" title=\"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set\">58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{AtFml}_S(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{AtFml}_S(L)\\)</span> is the set of atomic <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-formula codes and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}\">\\(\\operatorname{FV}\\)</span> is the recursively computed finite set of free variables.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma_\\in)\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma_\\in)\\)</span> is the membership-language <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> formula-code predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"5f363231f41efc07\" href=\"?note=5f363231f41efc07\" title=\"58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula\">58-df-zfc-sigma-one-formula</a>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assign}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assign}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are supplied by the dependencies.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\">\\(\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InfinitaryTruth}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InfinitaryTruth}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdmissibleSentenceTruth}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdmissibleSentenceTruth}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S\\)</span> are defined here.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}fragment}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq A:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{AtFml}_S(L)\\cap A\\subseteq C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in A\\to\\neg\\varphi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\exists v\\,\\varphi\\in A\\to\\exists v\\,\\varphi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall I\\in A\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\in A\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\Gamma,I,C)\\land\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\in A\\to\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\in C\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}fragment}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\coloneqq\\bigcap\\left\\{C\\subseteq A:\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\operatorname{AtFml}_S(L)\\cap A\\subseteq C\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;(\\neg\\varphi\\in A\\to\\neg\\varphi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in C\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;(\\exists v\\,\\varphi\\in A\\to\\exists v\\,\\varphi\\in C)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall I\\in A\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\in A\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Function}(\\Gamma,I,C)\\land\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\in A\\to\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\in C\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}sentences}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}sentences}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L):\\operatorname{FV}(\\varphi)=\\varnothing\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}assignment\\text{-}set}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\coloneqq\\{s\\in V:\\mathrm{Assign}(\\mathcal M,s)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryTruth}_S(V_{\\mathcal M,A},\\mathcal M,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land L\\in A\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(V_{\\mathcal M,A},\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\times\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M),2\\right)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_0,\\operatorname{Sat}_0\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_0,\\operatorname{Sat}_0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{AtFml}_S(L)\\cap A\\;\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\theta,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_0(\\theta,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\;\\left(\\neg\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\to\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\neg\\varphi,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle)=0\\bigr)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall I\\in A\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\in A\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Gamma,I,\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L))\\land\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\to\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in I\\;V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\Gamma(i),s\\rangle)=1\\bigr)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\left(\n\\exists v\\,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\to\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\exists v\\,\\varphi,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\varphi,s[v\\mapsto a]\\rangle)=1\\bigr)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}truth}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryTruth}_S(V_{\\mathcal M,A},\\mathcal M,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land L\\in A\\land\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\n\\mathrm{Function}\\!\\left(V_{\\mathcal M,A},\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\times\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M),2\\right)\\land\n\\exists\\operatorname{Val}_0,\\operatorname{Sat}_0\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathcal M,L,\\operatorname{Val}_0,\\operatorname{Sat}_0)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\theta\\in\\operatorname{AtFml}_S(L)\\cap A\\;\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\theta,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}_0(\\theta,s)\\bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\;\\left(\\neg\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\to\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\neg\\varphi,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle)=0\\bigr)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall I\\in A\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\in A\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Function}(\\Gamma,I,\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L))\\land\\bigwedge\\Gamma\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\to\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\bigwedge\\Gamma,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall i\\in I\\;V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\Gamma(i),s\\rangle)=1\\bigr)\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\;\\forall v\\in\\mathrm{Var}_S\\;\\left(\n\\exists v\\,\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Fml}_A(L)\\to\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;\n\\bigl(V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\exists v\\,\\varphi,s\\rangle)=1\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(\\mathcal M)\\;V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\varphi,s[v\\mapsto a]\\rangle)=1\\bigr)\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdmissibleSentenceTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\varphi,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\land\\exists V_{\\mathcal M,A}\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryTruth}_S(V_{\\mathcal M,A},\\mathcal M,A,L)\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle)=1\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}infinitary\\text{-}satisfaction}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdmissibleSentenceTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\varphi,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\varphi\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\land\\exists V_{\\mathcal M,A}\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{InfinitaryTruth}_S(V_{\\mathcal M,A},\\mathcal M,A,L)\\land\n\\forall s\\in\\operatorname{Asn}(\\mathcal M)\\;V_{\\mathcal M,A}(\\langle\\varphi,s\\rangle)=1\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S(T,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land L\\in A\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},p,\\psi\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land p\\in A\\land\n\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in A\\;\\exists s\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(s,\\langle t,p\\rangle,\\mathfrak A)\\land\n(t\\in T\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s))\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}sigma1\\text{-}theory}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{SigmaOneTheoryOver}_S(T,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land L\\in A\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\land\n\\exists\\mathfrak A,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat},p,\\psi\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak A,A)\\land\n\\mathrm{Satisfaction}_S(\\mathfrak A,\\Sigma_\\in,\\operatorname{Val},\\operatorname{Sat})\\land p\\in A\\land\n\\mathrm{SigmaOneFormula}_S(\\psi,\\Sigma_\\in)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall t\\in A\\;\\exists s\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{FiniteTupleAssignment}_S(s,\\langle t,p\\rangle,\\mathfrak A)\\land\n(t\\in T\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Sat}(\\psi,s))\\right)\n\\end{aligned}\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land L\\in A\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\n\\mathrm{AdmissibleSentenceTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\varphi,A,L)\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}logic9\\text{-}admissible\\text{-}satisfiability}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{AdmissiblySatisfiable}_S(T,A,L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcLogic9AdmissibleSet}_S(A)\\land L\\in A\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_A(L)\\land\\exists\\mathcal M\\;\\left(\n\\mathrm{Struct}_S(\\mathcal M,L)\\land\\forall\\varphi\\in T\\;\n\\mathrm{AdmissibleSentenceTruth}_S(\\mathcal M,\\varphi,A,L)\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The admissible fragment contains exactly the formula codes in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> generated from atoms by negation, first-order existential quantification, and conjunctions whose index and enumeration belong to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Infinitary truth is a set-coded recursive valuation on genuine assignments. Atomic truth is anchored to an explicitly selected first-order satisfaction recursion, and every conjunction index and quantified variable is bound.</li>\n<li>A theory may be external to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>, but being <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> forces all of its sentence codes to lie in the admissible fragment.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-logic9-admissible-set","status":"resolved","id":"4cbfb5925afe7f86","ancho